// Phase L2 (docs/nvidia-native.md): the glibc symbols libc.so.6 (libnvglibc_c) provides.
// Imports of NVIDIA 620.70.06's libGLX_nvidia, libnvidia-{glcore,glsi,tls,gpucomp,glvkspirv,
// rtcore,allocator,eglcore,ml}, libEGL_nvidia, libEGL and libGLdispatch (readelf --dyn-syms).
//   FWD(glibc name, bionic name): jumps straight to bionic (same ABI on x86_64).
//   WRAP(glibc name): jumps to nvg_<name> in libnvglibc.so (ABI translated there).
//   DATA(glibc name): an 8-byte variable that libnvglibc.so fills in at load.
// Undefined bionic names jump to nvglibc_missing(), which names the symbol and aborts.

